:"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-065","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001","quote":"王導，字茂弘，光祿大夫覽之孫也。父裁，鎮軍司馬。導少有風鑒，識量清遠。年十四，陳留高士張公見而奇之，謂其從兄敦曰：「此兒容貌志氣，將相之器也。」初襲祖爵即丘子。司空劉實尋引爲東閣祭酒，遷秘書郎、太子舍人、尚書郎，並不行。後參東海王越軍事。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001:m0082"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-jinshu065-wang-003:a001","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"司空","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001:m0082","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依正文任官、襲爵或用稱；未載起訖則留空，不把王洽卒於官解作未受中書令任滿，不補散騎為其他完整職名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001","text":"王導，字茂弘，光祿大夫覽之孫也。父裁，鎮軍司馬。導少有風鑒，識量清遠。年十四，陳留高士張公見而奇之，謂其從兄敦曰：「此兒容貌志氣，將相之器也。」初襲祖爵即丘子。司空劉實尋引爲東閣祭酒，遷秘書郎、太子舍人、尚書郎，並不行。後參東海王越軍事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"茂弘","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"覽","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"裁","kind":